<title>INDIA: India's IPCL down two pct before results.</title>
<headline>India's IPCL down two pct before results.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-05-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares of Indian Petrochemicals Corporation Ltd (IPCL) fell 2.25 rupees, or nearly two percent, to 125.50 at the Bombay exchange on Monday ahead of the release of its 1996/97 results, traders said.</p>
</text>
